  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Tasks related to providing civil security, food, water, shelter, and emergency medical treatment to civilians.&lt;SEP&gt;Essential tasks including providing civil security, food, water, shelter, and emergency medical treatment to civilians in accordance with laws of war.</data>
