</node>
<node id="Civil Security">
  <data key="d0">Civil Security</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A minimum-essential stability task provided to civilians located within a unit's area of operations.&lt;SEP&gt;Civil Security is one of the six primary stability tasks to be established by units.</data>
