<node id="Key Terrain">
  <data key="d0">Key Terrain</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Key Terrain is a tactical location that provides an advantage, mentioned as a destination for an avenue of approach or a position to be held in decisive engagements.&lt;SEP&gt;Key Terrain refers to strategic locations seized and secured by the 75th Ranger Regiment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-43827b67edd15288722ea2a5a3a94f03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2ba37bc0e16b243f02ab5b7be2e100c</data>
