<node id="75th Ranger Regiment">
  <data key="d0">75th Ranger Regiment</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">One of the two tactical regiments currently retained by the Army.&lt;SEP&gt;A direct reporting unit included within USASOC.&lt;SEP&gt;A unit receiving dedicated, mission-configured unmanned aircraft system support from the 160th Special Operations Aviation Regiment.&lt;SEP&gt;The 75th Ranger Regiment is a specially trained, rapidly deployable force that performs demanding missions in support of national and theater operational objectives.&lt;SEP&gt;The 75th Ranger Regiment is a conventional infantry unit specializing in complex offensive operations and participated in Operation JUST CAUSE.&lt;SEP&gt;The 75th Ranger Regiment is the Army's premier special operations infantry force capable of rapid deployment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3fc098f3a3543d54bc8f0881ae2eae85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b27d7d56a1c67174500dfb742aa9fc91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1118e47016e1aacd6394fca251ed2dba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-634019196f631f7ab3b7db7cf3971a9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c96559ad2979a6465236d374730b783&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2ba37bc0e16b243f02ab5b7be2e100c</data>
  <data key="d4">D:\Academic resources\ARN34828-ADP_3-90-000-WEB-1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;D:\Academic resources\ARN44116-FM_3-05-000-WEB-1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778755276</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="160th Special Operations Aviation Regiment">
  <data key="d0">160th Special Operations Aviation Regiment</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">One of the two tactical regiments currently retained by the Army.&lt;SEP&gt;A premier tactical unit conducting worldwide high-risk aviation operations and supporting joint force units with precision rotary-wing aviation.&lt;SEP&gt;The 160th Special Operations Aviation Regiment conducts and supports special operations missions for various commands and can be task-organized based on mission requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;The 160th Special Operations Aviation Regiment is the Army's special operations aviation unit supporting special operations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3fc098f3a3543d54bc8f0881ae2eae85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b27d7d56a1c67174500dfb742aa9fc91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2ba37bc0e16b243f02ab5b7be2e100c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ec1050b8c05b4ecb8bdb51a5d2c0abb</data>
  <data key="d4">D:\Academic resources\ARN34828-ADP_3-90-000-WEB-1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;D:\Academic resources\ARN44116-FM_3-05-000-WEB-1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778755276</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
