<node id="Army Special Operations Forces">
  <data key="d0">Army Special Operations Forces</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Army Special Operations Forces constitute the Active and Reserve Component Army forces designated to conduct and support special operations within the Department of Defense. These forces are manned, trained, and supported by USASOC to execute missions aligned with theater and national objectives. The organization serves as a collective term for Army special operations units receiving logistical and aviation support to conduct missions, including Special Forces groups and battalions. Specifically, the forces use the term "Groups" to designate large special forces and psychological operations units. Within doctrinal contexts, the term serves as a contextual header for the employment considerations of Psychological Operations units within the Army.

Operationally, Army Special Operations Forces are deployed globally and operate under theater special operations commands. Their logistics support situational awareness is maintained by the 528th Sustainment Brigade, ensuring necessary support for worldwide deployments. Historically, these forces have engaged in diverse missions across different regions. Army Special Operations Forces personnel remained in Panama supporting stability operations and conducted various missions during Operation Just Cause. Additionally, between 2014 and 2022, forces assisted Ukraine with the development of laws, messaging, and defense capabilities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3fc098f3a3543d54bc8f0881ae2eae85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d083ee11e02b24e5e46d8ecfba9df6bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b27d7d56a1c67174500dfb742aa9fc91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e2883359c75bc6fc3da995f38d6437f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1118e47016e1aacd6394fca251ed2dba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e2c950368aaaddb9954e21827ca6fc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65ca07053c85879007a4b12d71977eb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46540f7346ac66e8acd8448d556926d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02a07dcb1b08c46f988ffe232de0ba6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a83d27ea86b67140cb6a36139ae1786c</data>
  <data key="d4">D:\Academic resources\ARN34828-ADP_3-90-000-WEB-1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;D:\Academic resources\ARN44116-FM_3-05-000-WEB-1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778755314</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
