  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">A headquarters that independent battalions might consider themselves part of, although they actually serve a brigade.&lt;SEP&gt;The regimental headquarters works closely with mission partners to support the joint task force commander and operates in clandestine environments.&lt;SEP&gt;The Regimental Headquarters provides command and control and supports the Ranger Battalion.</data>
