  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Large units designated as "Groups" by Army special operations forces.&lt;SEP&gt;Accomplish military and U.S. national objectives through influence activities across the range of military operations.&lt;SEP&gt;Psychological Operations units lead influence efforts and execute supporting efforts for information activities during combat operations.&lt;SEP&gt;Psychological Operations Units are positioned to lead operations in the information environment for Army and joint force commanders.</data>
