<node id="Terrain-Following Flight">
  <data key="d0">Terrain-Following Flight</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A flight technique employed by the 160th Special Operations Aviation Regiment to avoid predictability and increase effectiveness.&lt;SEP&gt;Terrain-following flight is a technique employed by the regiment to achieve surprise and increase effectiveness during flight operations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b27d7d56a1c67174500dfb742aa9fc91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-634019196f631f7ab3b7db7cf3971a9d</data>
