  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Special Forces Group">
  <data key="d0">Special Forces Group</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">A regionally aligned organization containing varying numbers of operational detachments–alpha.&lt;SEP&gt;A Special Forces group has the capacity to command and control two to five Special Forces battalions.&lt;SEP&gt;A Special Forces Group receives mobility and support from one regiment of the 160th Special Operations Aviation Regiment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-51979d8934c76925b7391cb149c853a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7124d28a5494b25065ecde8dbfca305b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2ba37bc0e16b243f02ab5b7be2e100c</data>
