  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">An organization supported by expeditionary Civil Affairs battalions with region-specific culture and language expertise.&lt;SEP&gt;An organization responsible for SOF-peculiar sustainment requirements alongside USASOC.&lt;SEP&gt;USSOCOM is the organization from which a combatant commander may request the employment of a special operations joint task force.&lt;SEP&gt;The command to which service-designated special operations units are assigned.&lt;SEP&gt;The organization represented directly by the special operations liaison officer.&lt;SEP&gt;USSOCOM is an organization supported by the 160th Special Operations Aviation Regiment.</data>
