<node id="United States Army Special Operations Command">
  <data key="d0">United States Army Special Operations Command</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Command to which subordinate Army special operations units are assigned, also known as USASOC.&lt;SEP&gt;Serves as the Army component within USSOCOM, organized around three key subordinate commands and includes the 75th Ranger Regiment.&lt;SEP&gt;United States Army Special Operations Command (USASOC) oversees special operations detachments and determines their federal mission assignments.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1118e47016e1aacd6394fca251ed2dba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c96559ad2979a6465236d374730b783&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46540f7346ac66e8acd8448d556926d5</data>
