  <data key="d0">United States Special Operations Command</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The higher command within which USASOC serves as the Army component.&lt;SEP&gt;The United States Special Operations Command supports the joint force and the nation across the range of military operations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1118e47016e1aacd6394fca251ed2dba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e2c950368aaaddb9954e21827ca6fc1</data>
