  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">A branch supported by the JFK Special Warfare Center and consisting of groups within the 1st Special Forces Command.&lt;SEP&gt;Special Forces Soldiers are trained to execute core activities like unconventional warfare and foreign internal defense across military operations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1118e47016e1aacd6394fca251ed2dba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7124d28a5494b25065ecde8dbfca305b</data>
