  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">A branch supported by the JFK Special Warfare Center and represented by groups within the 1st Special Forces Command.&lt;SEP&gt;Psychological Operations involves tactical loudspeaker support and multimedia messaging to dissuade resistance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1118e47016e1aacd6394fca251ed2dba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e2c950368aaaddb9954e21827ca6fc1</data>
