  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The nation and people to whom the United States Army John F. Kennedy Special Warfare Center And School has a non-negotiable contract.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1118e47016e1aacd6394fca251ed2dba</data>
