  <data key="d0">1st Psychological Operations Battalion</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The 1st Psychological Operations Battalion provided tactical loudspeaker support to dissuade resistance during assaults.&lt;SEP&gt;The 1st Psychological Operations Battalion Soldiers jumped into Torrijos-Tocumen to provide tactical loudspeaker support.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7e2c950368aaaddb9954e21827ca6fc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c96559ad2979a6465236d374730b783</data>
