  <data key="d0">U.S. Air Force</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The U.S. Air Force provided fire support via an AC-130 gunship during Operation Just Cause.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7e2c950368aaaddb9954e21827ca6fc1</data>
