  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Joint Force Special Operations Component Command is the senior SOF representative responsible for recommending employment of assigned SOF.&lt;SEP&gt;A command that the Theater Special Operations Command serves as a bridge for prior to the establishment of a Special Operations Joint Task Force.</data>
