  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">North Atlantic Treaty Organization (NATO) is allied with United States forces, with a specific special operations detachment aligned to it.&lt;SEP&gt;An organization whose compliant model was adopted by the Armed Forces of Ukraine with assistance.</data>
