<node id="Special Operations Forces">
  <data key="d0">Special Operations Forces</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Special Operations Forces are military units tasked with special operations activities under specific command structures.&lt;SEP&gt;Forces designated for special operations, assigned to USSOCOM, and detailed in FM 3-05.&lt;SEP&gt;Military forces specializing in special operations, referenced throughout the document as SOF.&lt;SEP&gt;Special Operations Forces are sustained and enabled for extraction by the advanced operations base.&lt;SEP&gt;Special Operations Forces coordinate efforts across countries and theaters to support U.S. and partner nation objectives at a strategic level.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-89c2c3d76fec30a58c9326c2f2fbff67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f24a47cacf5b4d8c879d2cac52eda18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0b01db05e3701dde254ad8d25610798&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7124d28a5494b25065ecde8dbfca305b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ec1050b8c05b4ecb8bdb51a5d2c0abb</data>
