  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Official responsible for designating Army special operations forces.&lt;SEP&gt;The Secretary of Defense is provided with flexible deterrent or response options by the 75th Ranger Regiment in support of deterrence.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-634019196f631f7ab3b7db7cf3971a9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46540f7346ac66e8acd8448d556926d5</data>
