</node>
<node id="Liaison Officer">
  <data key="d0">Liaison Officer</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">A liaison officer is assigned to the controlling command structure to help with planning, operational integration, and coordination of communications.&lt;SEP&gt;A Liaison Officer acts as the commander's representative at another unit or agency to effect coordination and cooperation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-634019196f631f7ab3b7db7cf3971a9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ec1050b8c05b4ecb8bdb51a5d2c0abb</data>
