  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Direct action is a type of operation involving seizing, destroying, or capturing enemy forces or facilities, performed by the 75th Ranger Regiment.&lt;SEP&gt;Direct action is a core activity executed by Special Forces Soldiers.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-634019196f631f7ab3b7db7cf3971a9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7124d28a5494b25065ecde8dbfca305b</data>
