<node id="United States">
  <data key="d0">United States</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The United States initiated Operation JUST CAUSE to remove the Panamanian dictator and safeguard interests.&lt;SEP&gt;The United States is the nation whose resolve is demonstrated by the commitment of the 75th Ranger Regiment.&lt;SEP&gt;The United States is a nation whose SOF objectives are supported by liaison elements and embassy-based operations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-634019196f631f7ab3b7db7cf3971a9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c96559ad2979a6465236d374730b783&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7124d28a5494b25065ecde8dbfca305b</data>
