  <data key="d2">Government department containing the Army and the largest number of special operations units.&lt;SEP&gt;Conducts deception activities to deliberately mislead adversaries or conceal activities from foreign intelligence collection.&lt;SEP&gt;The Department of Defense receives support from special operations detachments during crises requiring defense support to civil authorities.</data>
