<node id="Ranger Battalion">
  <data key="d0">Ranger Battalion</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">A unit whose commander and staff normally establish a special operations task force.&lt;SEP&gt;A Ranger Battalion is supported by the regimental headquarters of the 75th Ranger Regiment.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ranger Battalion serves as the unit of action for a multidomain convergence headquarters.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2f24a47cacf5b4d8c879d2cac52eda18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2ba37bc0e16b243f02ab5b7be2e100c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3eaac3759faff54df152d27018118936</data>
