  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">A base that may control and support an advanced operations base.&lt;SEP&gt;A main operation base is a location where a special operations task force controls and supports an advanced operations base.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2f24a47cacf5b4d8c879d2cac52eda18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ec1050b8c05b4ecb8bdb51a5d2c0abb</data>
